r:inherit] [font-feature-settings:&#x27;ss01&#x27;]">@0x0funky</span></a></div><div dir="auto" class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-text line-clamp-5 text-body font-normal"><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-inherit">从这分享我联想到个idea:
一个程序，只要你把自己交易所账号API给它
它可以模拟交易所买卖界面
从第1天开始，每秒播放1天的交易、仓位变化
到最后一天，也可暂停/加速播放

比如365天交易过程，在5分钟播完
像一台时光机，以第一人称炒币视角
还原展示自己过去365天交易过程
是种神奇又实用的复盘工具?</span></div></div></div></article></div></div><div class="flex shrink items-center text-gray-700"><span class="inline-flex w-fit"><a id="_R_bqppimb6b5336_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger="" class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-gray-700 text-body font-normal hover:underline inline-flex w-fit" href="/coolish/status/1995742733324222738">6:32 AM · Dec 2, 2025</a><script nonce="P53LFmBDrkqyevypxbeekA==">window.__xClientTextFormatters?.run("_R_bqppimb6b5336_", "formatFullTimestamp", {"timestamp":1764657121000,"lang":"en","nowLabel":"Now"});</script></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 px-1 last:hidden">·</span><a class="rounded-xs focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring max-w-full text-subtext1 font-[inherit] font-chirp inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-gray-700 active" id="base-ui-_R_3uppimb6b5336_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger="" href="/coolish/status/1995742733324222738" data-status="active" aria-current="page"><div class="max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-bold text-primary">319.2K</div><div class="max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-normal text-gray-700">Views</div></a></div></div><div class="border-border my-2 border-t"></div><div class="-mx-2 flex h-5 min-h-5 w-[calc(100%+16px)] items-center justify-between overflow-visible"><div class="min-w-0 flex-1" data-engagement-action="reply"><a class="max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-[inherit] group inline-flex items-center rounded-full transition-colors focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 hover:text-blue-500 text-secondary" aria-label="Reply" href="/coolish/status/1995742733324222738"><span class="relative isolate inline-flex items-center rounded-full before:-z-10 before:pointer-events-none before:absolute before:inset-0 before:rounded-full before:scale-[0.88] before:opacity-[0] before:transition-[opacity,scale] before:durati